WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.800
Our meeting was just chance,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.270
and at first, I didn’t know anything.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:13.100
But when I saw you crying
in front of me, for some reason, I felt sad.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.050
And it tore my heart in two when you clutched at me and yelled, “Don’t go!”

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.750
And when you smile, I’m so happy.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.820
I can’t put it into words, but you mean the world to me.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.740
I didn’t keep my promise.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.700
I will definitely keep it this time.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.220
So just wait a bit longer.

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.300
Mama will save you!

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:05.960
The things that I can do for you and no one else

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:11.660
I honestly feel and wish for those

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:18.380
I am frozen by uncertainties

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:24.620
By the rules I have been relying on

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:30.320
My past embellished with excuses

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.520
I want to get over it

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.800
Staining the stars in heaven scarlet

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.270
Gather the grains of miracles

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.530
Before the still, unseen night

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.810
I want to tell you that I am escaping from illusions

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.990
The twilight moon calls out to me

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.080
Removing my veil of delusions

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:57.290
My hidden, deceitful self

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:01.170
And took all of my weaknesses

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:07.630
I don’t want words that seem passionate

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:17.050
The fact that I’m here right now is my truth

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.260
Are you okay, Eisen?

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:48.620
No problem.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:56.180
Nanoha must be in the throne room by now.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.600
Yes.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:02.890
And Hayate’s fighting outside, waiting for the ship to stop.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:03.550
Correct.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:19.070
I’m going to smash this thing into pieces and stop the ship.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:22.660
You can do our Limit Break, right?

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:23.490
Roger.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:26.370
Obliteration Form

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.000
<b>Obliteration...</b>

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.760
<b>...Hammer</b>

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:52.850
Mana signature detected.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:58.260
Engaging defense mode.

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:01.320
Anything that approaches the engine room

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.570
will be immediately attacked.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.870
Bring it on!

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:17.190
Forty-five minutes until the Dimensional Navy arrives.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:22.050
Thirty-eight minutes until the <i>Cradle</i> reaches its destination.

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:23.150
A seven-minute gap.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:27.750
The <i>Cradle’</i>s main cannon
is pointed directly at Mid’s capital.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.350
Seven minutes is enough...

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.080
...to fire the cannon, yeah.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.730
Maintain present defense line!

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.250
Someone take over command for me!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.210
I’m going in!

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:43.050
I can’t let it reach orbit. I can’t let it attack the surface.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.500
Commander Yagami!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:45.470
But...

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:49.180
Excuse me! This is Long Arch 3.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.350
Alto?

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:54.270
Commander Yagami, wait just a little longer.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.630
I have an important item for you!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.110
Vivio.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.000
Don’t say my name!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:26.720
Chain Bind

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.850
This stuff...

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.000
...won’t work!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.180
Round Shield

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:55.600
W.A.S.: Area 2 complete, beginning Area 3.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.460
This will take some time.

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.660
<b>Blaster 2</b>

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:06.400
Blaster 2nd

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:19.810
<b>Blaster Bit: Crystal Cage</b>

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:21.400
Lock!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:30.910
I already know this trick!

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.090
I thought so!

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:53.920
Your Majesty, keep making that devil use her power-up.

00:06:53.920 --> 00:07:01.350
That “Blaster” system is an experimental booster that far surpasses the physical limits of the user’s body.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:07.990
Every shot fired and every blow blocked
whittles away at her life and the life of her Device.

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:16.140
For a special move that just kicks the crap out of everything, it’s almost unbeatable.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:19.410
It’s quite powerful.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:27.800
But it’s useless in this situation.

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:42.190
They’re crying!

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:47.570
They don’t know what to do.

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:53.320
Jirai-Oh, don’t!

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:01.620
Galue.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:07.440
Caro, take Lu and head up!

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:15.550
We’ll stop Jirai-Oh and the others!

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.880
You’re coming with me.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:24.850
I refuse.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:29.530
I must go save Lutecia and stop Scaglietti.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:33.490
Scaglietti and the combat cyborgs have already been captured,

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:38.450
and my men are moving to secure Lutecia Alpine.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.810
Is that so?

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:44.370
Then, there’s only one thing left for me to do.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.330
Sir, why?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.000
Be quiet!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:56.590
I was supposed to dream and gaze at the future,
but before I knew it, I stepped off the path.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:04.730
To protect what you must truly protect
is all there is to it, but that’s truly difficult.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:28.730
Glittering Swordflash

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:34.240
Sir!

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:45.100
That mini-knight in the engine room.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:50.770
Crap.

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:16.590
Why?

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:19.510
Why isn’t it working?

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:24.470
If I don’t destroy it, it’ll hurt everybody!

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.910
I won’t be able to protect

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:31.190
Hayate and Nanoha!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:36.110
If I can’t break through that shielding, there’s no point!

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.850
So then, Eisen!

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:39.800
Roger!

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:51.350
Rest in pieces!

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.370
It didn’t work.

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:08.330
I couldn’t protect them.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.010
Hayate...

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:11.510
Everyone...

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:12.290
Sorry.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:23.620
There’s nothing for you to apologize for.

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:27.650
Hayate.

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:31.450
Rein.

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:32.460
Yeppers.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:40.040
Vita, Knight of the Steel Hammer, and Graf Eisen
fought valiantly until they ended up like this.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:52.830
There’s nothing in the worlds...

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:57.460
...they cannot destroy.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.410
The engine.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.430
They’re sealing the hallways?

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:42.400
Rossa!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:46.870
Feels like they’re going to activate a self-destruct device or something.

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:50.290
What is this?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:55.070
Quattro has decided to abandon this base, it seems.

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:56.160
Stop her.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.070
You’ll die with it.

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:02.830
I told you, my copy is inside of her.

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:05.220
There’s no longer a use for this body.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.330
Defense systems at full power.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.730
Reserve engine activated.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.710
Self-repair systems in effect.

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:18.980
We’re not finished yet.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.360
That’s...!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.890
Wide Area Search successful.

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:31.080
Coordinates are specific. Distance calculated.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.490
Found you!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.660
Area Search?

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:41.500
No way! She’s been looking for me this whole time?

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:44.250
But this is the deepest part of the <i>Cradle!</i>

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:46.490
Nobody could make it all the way down here.

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:56.580
She’s going to just blast through the walls?
No way! Can’t be! Ridiculous!

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:08.060
Clearance confirmation: firing lock is cancelled.

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:09.840
<b>Blaster 3</b>

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:13.960
<b>Divine...</b>

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:23.320
<b>...Buster</b>

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:47.840
The Doctor’s dream... we... will...

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.740
The Gadgets have completely stopped.

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:04.140
Same for the other areas.

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:07.550
The Riot Force 6 girls did it?

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:13.950
Vivio?

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:15.680
Vivio!

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.350
Mama Nanoha...

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:21.250
No, run!

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:25.440
It won’t work?

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:33.910
I can’t go back?

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:39.620
Engines damaged. Helm unmanned.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:42.780
The Holy King has lost the will to fight.

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:46.730
Now entering automatic defense mode.

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:50.580
All fighters, scramble!

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:53.030
Eliminate all objects.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.290
Let’s go, Rein!

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:57.450
We’ll blow through them and keep going!

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:06.640
Vivio, I’m going to save you.

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:08.220
It’s hopeless!

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:09.560
I can’t stop!

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:11.050
It’s not hopeless!

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.090
Stay away.

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:33.250
I know.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:35.870
I’m a copy of a person from the distant past.

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:43.020
And Nanoha, I know you and and Fate
aren’t my real mamas.

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:47.800
I’m just a key to move this ship.

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:50.220
I’m a living weapon that protects the throne room.

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:51.570
That’s not true!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:55.090
I never had a mama.

00:16:56.180 --> 00:17:02.480
I was just looking for a person who would protect me,
who would let me gather magical data.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.040
That’s not true!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.710
It is!

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:12.650
All my sadness, my pain, they were all fake, created things.

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:16.990
I can’t be allowed to live!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:20.370
That’s not true!

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:28.880
No matter how you were born, the Vivio that’s there crying isn’t a fake or something that was merely created.

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:34.030
She’s the spoiled girl who cries all the time
and can’t even get up on her own when she trips.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:37.200
The girl who hates her green peppers,

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:41.660
the girl who gives me headpats
and calls me “good girl” when I’m feeling lonely.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.080
My beloved Vivio.

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:55.510
I’m not your real mama, Vivio,
but I’m going to try my best to be.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:18:00.580
So don’t say that you can’t be allowed to live.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:04.260
Tell Mama your true feelings.

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:06.010
I...

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.880
I...

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:09.770
Mama Nanoha...

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:10.860
I love you!

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.800
I want to be with you forever, Mama!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:16.370
Mama.

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:18.880
Save me!

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:22.140
I will.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.910
No matter when, no matter what!

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:31.900
Restrict Lock

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:50.960
Vivio, this might be a bit painful.

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:57.860
I’ll blow her defenses
and knock her out with magical damage.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:00.310
You can do it, right, Raising Heart?

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:01.590
Clear to go.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.410
Full power!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.330
<b>Starlight...</b>

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:14.980
<b>...Breaker</b>

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:32.000
Break...

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:36.590
...shoot!

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:01.180
Vivio.

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:04.720
Vivio!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.390
Stay back!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.560
I can do it on my own.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:39.460
I promised I’d be strong.

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:51.670
The <i>Cradle’</i>s speed has dropped!

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:54.690
The rate of ascent has dropped dramatically.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:57.860
The fleet will get there first!

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.520
The seven-minute gap is filled!

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:00.530
Holy King unresponsive. System down.
The seven-minute gap is filled!

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:07.060
Holy King unresponsive. System down.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.510
Nanoha!

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.270
Hayate!

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:16.600
Blocking all mana links. Restoring ship functionality.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:23.540
All personnel aboard, enter sleep mode!

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:29.040
Everything I know about the incident is inside here.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:30.790
I’ll take them.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:34.020
Can I ask you to take care of Agito and Lutecia?

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:39.460
They’re unfortunate children
who never met the people they were supposed to meet.

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:41.400
Sir!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:42.850
Agito.

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:48.990
The days I spent with you and Lutecia
really weren’t that bad.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:53.190
It’s a lovely sky.

00:21:53.190 --> 00:21:54.370
It is.

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:58.080
Please continue to watch over

00:21:58.080 --> 00:22:02.320
the world that Regius and I
wanted to protect, without faltering.

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:07.130
Sir!

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:14.000
Subaru!

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:15.460
Tia!

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:19.650
The Gadgets are shutting down everywhere.

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:21.090
What happened?

00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:22.550
I don’t know.

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:24.390
I’m sure that Nanoha and the others...

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:28.680
Subaru, is Ginga okay?

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:29.820
Yes.

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:39.820
They stopped the ship from going up any further,
but the battle is continuing inside.

00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:43.670
We can’t contact Nanoha or the others who went in.

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:48.040
An indoor evacuation and rescue mission...

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:49.800
That’s a ground mage’s job.

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:50.280
Yes, sir.

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:51.280
Subaru.

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:53.890
Ginny.

00:22:55.360 --> 00:22:56.310
Take this.

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:22.880
Nanoha.

00:25:16.840 --> 00:25:19.240
When the case is closed,

00:25:19.240 --> 00:25:22.620
and when Riot Force 6’s
mission is complete.

00:25:22.620 --> 00:25:27.120
Even when we’re apart, there are things that remain, things we won’t ever forget.

00:25:33.520 --> 00:25:34.780
Take off!
